                 ("p", "Evolution Golf Academy exists because of a gap that anyone who has tried to improve at golf in the East Midlands will recognise straight away. Elite coaching and serious practice technology were available, but almost always behind a private club membership, a joining fee and a committee, or else at the end of a forty five minute drive to somewhere that could fit you in three weeks on Tuesday afternoon. Golfers were being asked to choose between convenience and quality, and quality usually lost."),
