                 ("p", "Being here rather than inside either city was a deliberate choice. A <strong>golf academy near Derby and Nottingham</strong> only works if both sets of golfers can get to it after work without resenting the journey, and the A610 does that job better than anything running through a city centre. Fifteen minutes from Derby, twenty from Nottingham, and neither trip involves a park and ride or a parking charge."),
